<title>CHINA: China lifts East China Sea fishing ban.</title>
<headline>China lifts East China Sea fishing ban.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>China has lifted a two-month ban on fishing in an area of the East China Sea, the Xinhua news agency said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The ban, imposed to build up fish stocks and enforced throughout July and August, had stopped fishing boats from plying the waters between 35 degrees north and 27 degrees north, the agency said.</p>
<p>China imposed a similar ban in the same area in July and August 1995.</p>
</text>
